  "prefLabel": "Ph 2101.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2101.02 Scope. Registrants and licensees, including all pharmacists, pharmacies, and practitioners pursuant to RSA 318:8-a and RSA 318:9-a, shall permit the board investigators, board inspectors, and board commissioners to enter and inspect the premises and audit the records and operations for compliance with the statutes and rules enforced by or under the board’s jurisdiction.\n\nSource. #13028, eff 4-11-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
